{"info": {"address1": "B-24, Hingna MIDC Area", "address2": "Hingna Road", "city": "Nagpur", "zip": "440016", "country": "India", "phone": "91 71 0466 8000", "website": "https://www.mmpil.com", "industry": "Aluminum", "industryKey": "aluminum", "industryDisp": "Aluminum", "sector": "Basic Materials", "sectorKey": "basic-materials", "sectorDisp": "Basic Materials", "longBusinessSummary": "MMP Industries Limited engages in the manufacture, sale, distribution, and trade of aluminium products in India. The company operates in four segments: Aluminium Powders and Pastes, Aluminium Conductors, Aluminium Foils, and Others. It offers pyro, flake, and atomized aluminum powders for use in various sectors, including construction and mining, agriculture, defense, firecrackers, railways, etc.; aluminum pastes; and aluminum conductors and cables used by the power sector. It also provides aluminum foils that are used in pharmaceutical and food packaging applications; and manganese oxide/dioxide, washers, circlips, and coal products. It also engages in trading and manufacturing of MnO and MnO2 Powder. It exports its products to countries in Europe, the Middle-East, and Africa. The company was formerly known as Maharashtra Metal Powders Limited and changed its name to MMP Industries Limited in June 2012. MMP Industries Limited was incorporated in 1973 and is based in Nagpur, India.", "fullTimeEmployees": 523, "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Arun Raghuvirraj Bhandari", "age": 70, "title": "Chairman & Managing Director", "yearBorn": 1955, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 13440000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Sharad Mohanlal Khandelwal", "title": "Chief Financial Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 3164000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Madhura Kiran Ubale C.S.", "title": "Company Secretary & Compliance Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 1036000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexer